# Requisições de exemplo. Gere um token local com:
#   dotnet user-jwts create --project src/Services/Scheduling/CareFlow.Scheduling.Api \
#     --scope scheduling.write --claim tenant_id=11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111 -o token
@host = http://localhost:5114
@token = cole-o-token-aqui
@professional = 22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222

### Reservar consulta
POST {{host}}/v1/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: exemplo-0001

{
  "professionalId": "{{professional}}",
  "patientRef": "33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333",
  "startsAt": "2030-01-15T13:00:00Z",
  "endsAt": "2030-01-15T13:30:00Z"
}

### Horários ocupados do profissional
GET {{host}}/v1/professionals/{{professional}}/appointments?from=2030-01-15T00:00:00Z&to=2030-01-16T00:00:00Z
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Saúde
GET {{host}}/health/ready
